      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While appearing as offline wasn't included, user status has been added with VRChat 2018.2.3! https://docs.vrchat.com/v2018.2.3/docs/vrchat-201823\n\nI'm not marking this post as complete because not all of your suggestions were added. With that in mind, please split feature requests into individual posts in the future if possible. Thanks!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
