  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-03-08T15:49:01.210Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Being a social game, VRChat could use a few additions that would improve it. One of those would be the ability to hide your online status to your friends. This could come with just the options to show as online or show as offline, or it could also have additional status options such as away. The other option would be having text when looking at offline friends that reads \"Last seen 15 minutes ago\" or however long ago they were online. Sometimes its nice to know these times so I can meet up with a friend when they would normally get online. You would also have the option to turn off showing other people when you were last online. Just some console-like functionality would be useful.",
